<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Launcher icon: sound bars rising like a sunrise, centred on the 108x108 canvas (centre 54,54).
     The bars span x 31..77 and y 34..70: the group sits 2dp above the middle because bars that share a
     bottom line look low when centred exactly. LauncherIconTest checks this, keep the paths' format. -->
